CCOONNFFIIGGUURRAATTIIOONN PPAARRAAMMEETTEERRSS
       Unlike most Postfix daemon processes, the mmaasstteerr(8) server does not au‐
       tomatically pick up changes to mmaaiinn..ccff. Changes to mmaasstteerr..ccff are  never
       picked up automatically.  Use the "ppoossttffiixx rreellooaadd" command after a con‐
       figuration change.

